 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Welcome. A big gathering like this needs planning like a wedding. Great. A few big sheets of paper and post it on the wall for a few weeks let everyone see how close you are on planning. Let each person bring something so it feels more like a meal than a feed. You could suggest that. Or maybe a traditional dish from somewhere someone still lives. A big hall or a big living room works best. A dance floor can get crowded.",
